sequenceDiagram
  participant Gateway as Operator Gateway
  participant Dpmw as DPM Wallet
  participant Plaee as Plaee Backend
  participant Relayer as relayer-api

  Gateway->>Dpmw: POST /v1/addresses
  Dpmw->>Dpmw: derive EOA at next index, compute proxy address
  Dpmw-->>Gateway: address, proxyAddress, index
  Gateway->>Plaee: register customer address
  Plaee-->>Gateway: persisted in dpm-db
  Note over Gateway,Relayer: only now can meta-transactions be signed
  Gateway->>Dpmw: POST /v1/meta-tx/allowance
  Dpmw->>Relayer: GET /relay-payload?address=EOA&type=PROXY
  Relayer-->>Dpmw: relayer address, nonce
  Dpmw-->>Gateway: complete SubmitTransactionRequest body
